  "question": {
    "text": "All the students of a class performed poorly in physics. The teacher decided to give grace marks of <math><mn>15</mn></math> to the entire class. Which of the following statistical measures will not change even after the grace marks were given?"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "median",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "mode",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "variance",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "mean",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Variance is not changed by the change of origin.<br /><math><mi>σ</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∑</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math>. Therefore, <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∑</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∑</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>σ</mi></math>.<br />&nbsp;"
  }
